menu "Codex Micro board bring-up"
config CODEX_MAINBOARD_BRINGUP
    bool "Mainboard-only diagnostic firmware (no physical input reports)"
    default y
    help
        Keep USB/CDC, raw input diagnostics and explicit USB firmware maintenance.
        Disable business input reports, local gestures, BLE and lighting outputs.
        Disable this only for a deliberately built full peripheral firmware.
config CODEX_BOARD_SERVICES
    bool "Enable config maintenance and BLE while physical inputs remain suppressed"
    default y
    help
        Enables explicit configuration RPC, controlled reboot, Host state handling
        and BLE bonding tests. Does not enable raw input actions or lighting output.
config CODEX_USB_MICROPHONE
    bool "INMP441 left-channel USB microphone (GPIO12/13/14, L/R grounded)"
    default y
    help
        Append UAC2 microphone interfaces to HID+CDC. 48 kHz mono PCM16.
        Independent of the switch/joystick diagnostic suppression policy.
endmenu
